4. NORMATIVE STANDARDS, RFCS & SPECIFICATIONS REFERENCED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

lh-audit-report-gen implements or validates compliance against the following public
engineering standards, RFCs, and security specifications:

  * ISO 32000-1 / Adobe PDF 1.4 Binary File Format Specification, ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A, India CERT-In Cyber Security Directions (28 April 2022), FIRST TLP v2.0
